{
 "encounter_id": "00808",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "So, my left calf. It cramps up when I walk, just a couple of blocks, and I have to stop. Two blocks, no, maybe three."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Like a charley horse?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Kind of, but it's more of a squeeze, and it goes away if I stand still for a few minutes."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "When did this start?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Oh. Last fall. Or was it the winter before? I really couldn't tell you, it kind of crept up."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Anything else in the leg?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "My left foot gets cold. Colder than the right. And it aches at night, in the arch, and I hang it over the side of the bed and that helps."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Do your legs feel tired?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Heavy, yes, by evening."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any chest pain when you walk?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No chest pain."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Short of breath?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Not really, no."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Swelling in the legs?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No swelling."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any back pain, shooting down the leg?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, it's just the calf."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Numbness?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No numbness."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What do you take?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Atorvastatin, maybe 40 mg, at night. And lisinopril, 10 mg, every day. Well, most days. I forget it sometimes when I'm travelling."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "So most days. Allergies?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Contrast dye, from a scan. I'm allergic, they told me, but I can't remember what happened."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "History?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "High cholesterol, high blood pressure, and pre-diabetes."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Surgery?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Knee scope, in 2012."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Family?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "My father lost a leg to circulation trouble. My mother had a stroke."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Do you smoke?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A pack a day for thirty years. I'm trying to quit."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Drink?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A couple of beers on weekends."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Do you exercise?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I walk the dog, but I can't go far. That's how it got noticed."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let me check you. Blood pressure 148 over 88, pulse 82, temperature 36.8, oxygen 97 percent, breathing 16, and weight 96 kilos.",
   "pause": 15.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "That's high, huh? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "A bit. Now let me feel for the pulses in your feet. Think of the artery as a garden hose.",
   "pause": 10.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A hose? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "If the hose is kinked or clogged, the water doesn't reach the end. I can feel a pulse in your right foot, but I can't feel a pulse at the left foot."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Oh. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And the left foot is cooler than the right, and a bit shiny."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "That's what I noticed. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any trouble with your breathing?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, nothing like that."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What I think is happening is narrowing of the arteries in the leg."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is that the hose? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Exactly. I'd like to arrange a test comparing the blood pressure in your ankle and your arm, an ultrasound of the leg arteries, and blood tests for cholesterol and sugar."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "When can that happen? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Reception will book them. And I'd like to start clopidogrel, 75 mg, once a day, to thin the blood."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Okay. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "The biggest thing you can do is stop smoking. It's like pouring sludge in the hose."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I know. I will. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'd like to see you again in two weeks."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Two weeks. Thanks, doc. ~"
  }
 ],
